he adopted contract, including a reconciliation-first valid answer and an unconditional-retry invalid answer (S3). In one fixed client/model/effort/tool configuration, compare no method and Z on the same genuinely new task groups kept out of development and grader calibration. Randomize paired run order, retain every task and timeout, and report paired improvements and regressions. Measure executor time and actual billing, preparation, review and correction separately (S1, S2). Prespecify the quality gain and cost evidence needed for release; the supplied records do not justify an exact confirmatory sample size. Expand the new matched study if uncertainty remains. This is proposed work, and these records establish neither benefit in the population nor equivalence (S1-S4).\n"
